lia di un noto uomo politico e chiede al padre, per salvare le apparenze, di fingersi \"normale\", ma la verità viene ugualmente a galla.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"1978-10-20","status":"Released","rating":6.832,"ratingCount":459,"genres":["Commedia"],"countries":["France","Italy"],"facts":{"Runtime":"103m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":32312,"name":"Ugo Tognazzi","role":"Renato Baldi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oHnqb2oEWbUfAPuU2P351HNGRX7.jpg"},{"id":12270,"name":"Michel Serrault","role":"Zaza","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/quttZiihxZ9Cpxw4WhbYFfcmitE.jpg"},{"id":1654,"name":"Claire Maurier","role":"Simone Deblon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rlMYKpiTIzZCw2ee3YGENJZQKPC.jpg"},{"id":38510,"name":"Rémi Laurent","role":"Laurent Baldi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/usQ6yF7fYVf7QrIM9oXbK4Rb10V.jpg"},{"id":38511,"name":"Carmen Scarpitta","role":"Louise Charrier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4npO1nnFPt23iqcLpevxGJEDrOX.jpg"},{"id":38512,"name":"Benny Luke","role":"Jacob","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/95C97k4fYAs2yW1yGjimdgptfRl.jpg"},{"id":38513,"name":"Luisa Maneri","role":"Andréa Charrier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lt3lBVOl0AJvzuCLElhu4DjsDHn.jpg"},{"id":24629,"name":"Michel Galabru","role":"Simon Charrier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f6uvYIfc6cgQkn713rViFXIUCn0.jpg"},{"id":22312,"name":"Venantino Venantini","role":"Le chauffeur de Charrier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pHrMrrQqeer9BwurQ0zC1DKsXag.jpg"},{"id":44967,"name":"Carlo Reali","role":"Le videur","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qOlcCKGGjDGJWXyq62E9oPaWmC1.jpg"},{"id":1137519,"name":"Guido Cerniglia","role":"Le médecin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lS3MVavgLHsuoU34LuJc2AOsqRM.jpg"},{"id":232886,"name":"Angelo Pellegrino","role":"Un assistant de la boîte de nuit","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wDCmGI9GM8pDZ7basQRho8Fj0q5.jpg"},{"id":1706402,"name":"Nicola D'Eramo","role":"Un artiste du cabaret","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/npkRqUtS0ZYPFOCLOHd3gy8IXVj.jpg"},{"id":1315511,"name":"Vinicio Diamanti","role":"Henri dit Mercédès","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kma4U0HpgrwxgW4XtevBawZs2ui.jpg"},{"id":1090000,"name":"Liana Del Balzo","role":"Madame Charrier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i7kaMUqFdFHlCpoLMhwIsH3Pmw.jpg"},{"id":85649,"name":"Piero Mazzinghi","role":"Un journaliste"},{"id":1945878,"name":"Walter Lucchini","role":"Salomé"},{"id":2741785,"name":"Bruno Sgueglia","role":"Le caissier du cabaret","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mpitmPYxzYY38N9qiAdL1mzcUID.jpg"},{"id":102371,"name":"Margherita Horowitz","role":"La secrétaire de Madame Deblon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2acUHDMwfrWzpCn87sBN4d66w1O.jpg"},{"id":101557,"name":"Antonio Maimone","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2sbr5BIFIsQksBktYQ423fTAaLe.jpg"},{"id":1637246,"name":"Antonio Maronese"},{"id":1567171,"name":"Edmondo Tieghi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ehqPMkCBJxGaiIeuakbMhaaabAS.jpg"},{"id":548339,"name":"Peter Boom","role":"Un serveur au restaurant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fUXNd4P8BuvQt37Zhpe8dzZz13P.jpg"},{"id":564901,"name":"Cesare Nizzica","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1m3FLlYwu6lsMbVwbscu3yqOh0e.jpg"},{"id":5559489,"name":"Giancarlo Pellegrini","role":"Le régisseur de la boîte de nuit"},{"id":5559490,"name":"Mariano Brancaccio"},{"id":1678969,"name":"Renato De Montis"},{"id":5559491,"name":"Vittorio Podini"},{"id":1303568,"name":"Giuseppe di Bella","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lTbxpfwx8lybULGkLA8vD05wvJ2.jpg"},{"id":2019360,"name":"Paolo Di Bella"},{"id":5559492,"name":"Alberto Ambrosio"},{"id":4773263,"name":"Rolando Quaranta"},{"id":1282397,"name":"Erminio Bianchi Fasani","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tnfzmWxR4OlCX5K7gP6dIzWtO56.jpg"},{"id":5559493,"name":"Maxime Cambe"},{"id":225190,"name":"Mimmo Poli","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ogRb16e5BplvdpngH3Txhp3Y0pb.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il vizietto","overview":"Renato, di origini italiane, e Albin, detto Zazà, gestiscono a Saint Tropez la \"Cage aux folles\", un locale notturno per travestiti. Vivono insieme come marito e moglie da anni. Renato però, in passato, ha avuto una breve esperienza eterosessuale dalla quale è nato Laurent. Il figlio annuncia il suo matrimonio con la figlia di un noto uomo politico e chiede al padre, per salvare le apparenze, di fingersi \"normale\", ma la verità viene ugualmente a galla."},{"language":"en-US","title":"La Cage aux Folles","overview":"Two gay men living in St. Tropez have their lives turned upside down when the son of one of the men announces he is getting married. They try to conceal their lifestyle and their ownership of the drag club downstairs when the fiancée and her parents come for dinner."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"À Nice, la boîte de nuit  « La Cage aux folles » est un lieu quelque peu spécial qui produit des spectacles de travestis. Les propriétaires, qui vivent au premier étage sont un couple de longues date d'homosexuels. Renato, en charge de l'exploitation de la boîte et Albin qui s'y produit sous le nom de scène « Zaza ». Dans ses jeunesse, Renato a eu un fils, Laurent, d'une union hétérosexuelle et ce jeune homme a 21 ans aujourd'hui et va se marier avec Andréa. Il a quelque peu arrangé le pédigrée de son père parce que son futur beau-père, Simon Charrier, est le vice-président de l'Ordre Moral, un parti des plus conservateurs. Les beaux-parents prévoient de se rendre à Nice pour rencontrer la future famille. C'est là que les problèmes vont commencer parce qu'il va falloir effacer, masquer, changer toute trace de leur vie jusqu'à Jacob « la domestique de maison » qui détonneraient avec la haute moralité des parents d'Andréa. Et pour Zaza, que faisons-nous ?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2zIk2qajP33r5OZI6jsWF5qs6zU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xkrLPXpDBwzKW0jzbUEzqnnusLb.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":4484,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2zIk2qajP33r5OZI6jsWF5qs6zU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2zIk2qajP33r5OZI6jsWF5qs6zU.jpg","language":"it","width":1067,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2zIk2qajP33r5OZI6jsWF5qs6zU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2zIk2qajP33r5OZI6jsWF5qs6zU.jpg","language":"it","width":1067,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qw2YVzWzzZpt4rbn5B4qscbyH1N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qw2YVzWzzZpt4rbn5B4qscbyH1N.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2250},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/riRToAFXDV1O8blGOEIcpLDLnqV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/riRToAFXDV1O8blGOEIcpLDLnqV.jpg","language":"it","width":768,"height":1024},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v7qlS3Zz7kcvYNHhsWJQ2ejVWBH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v7qlS3Zz7kcvYNHhsWJQ2ejVWBH.jpg","language":"it","width":768,"height":1152},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bC10oRzE5QvoRv7KgJTueU4Eyea.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bC10oRzE5QvoRv7KgJTueU4Eyea.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMz9BUs3qIAx5UAO5BLiufzVwrr.jpg","previ